Title: "Expression Alias"
Id: "c45c4158-5b55-45a7-aa3a-c0d1d2f7588e"

Text: "Expression aliases use `:=>` and may appear as ordinary `alias:` groups or inside `capability:` items.

```mlg-fragment
Aliases:
. alias: f(x_) :=> x_ + x_

Enables:
. capability: x_ - y_ :=> x_ \\.set.minus./ y_
```

The left side describes the notation being introduced. The right side is the expression it expands to for checking and rendering support."
Id: "bd479067-4a3f-4ec5-aebd-3d5c1e8ad2f5"
